+    /// One step of the prompt pass: opened (or set up again after another stream's chunks), one chunk, and at its end
+    /// the head's draw of the first token; true once drawn. The other streams' rounds may run between steps: the
+    /// Engram read-ahead is joined before this returns (a round's Engram reads share its buffers).
+    fn prefillStepFn(ptr: *anyopaque, s: *lanes.Stream) anyerror!bool {
         const self = of(ptr);
         const m = self.m;
         const gpa = self.gpa;
         const t0 = m.now();
